# --------------------------------
# Ephemeral scratch working dirs (regenerated on demand).
# Files intentionally committed under scratch/ stay tracked; gitignore only
# affects untracked files, so this just hides the working-scratch noise.
# --------------------------------
scratch/
notebooks/scratch/
tools/_scratch_*.py

# --------------------------------
# graphify knowledge graph (local-only; rebuild with `/graphify . --update`)
# --------------------------------
graphify-out/

# --------------------------------
# Outdoor WBGT Route B pilot: large generated artifacts (local-only).
# `ACCESS-CM2/yearly_metrics.csv` is the grid-first pilot compute output
# (`tools.diagnostics.wbgt_route_b_run`); the other two are derived from it by
# `python -m tools.diagnostics.wbgt_route_b_pilot --build`. The committed
# evidence JSONs record their hashes and provenance.
# --------------------------------
docs/diagnostics/wbgt_outdoor_route_b_pilot/ACCESS-CM2/yearly_metrics.csv
docs/diagnostics/wbgt_outdoor_route_b_pilot/working_pilot/pilot_yearly.csv
docs/diagnostics/wbgt_outdoor_route_b_pilot/working_pilot/index.html
